Two files of this repository are derived from microduck-playground files at
commit f010ef1 and were modified. Each file starts with a list of the changes.

  src/microduck_dance/basketball_finetune.py  from src/mjlab_microduck/basketball_finetune.py
  scripts/finetune_basketball.py              from scripts/finetune_basketball.py

